# The throw: its key plays the arm's throw (Throwing: its pack reads it); the clip's marker,
# grenade.release, lets go of the one carried, with 4 s to live (the mod sets it off on a hit).

# Without the marker (a body the arm's pack does not fit) it lets go a moment later anyway.
motion Throwing on use
	item carried
	cooldown 0.7
	lasts 0.7
	then when grenade.release within 0.3
	emit grenade.thrown
	launch carried speed 17 lift 3 ahead 0.8 seconds 4
	timeout
	emit grenade.thrown
	launch carried speed 17 lift 3 ahead 0.8 seconds 4
